    {
      "id": "workflow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 正确生成链\n\n1. 运行 `scrape_vogue_image_records.py`，为1000个Look抓取候选 `image_url`。\n2. 人工核验 `image_url` 与 `source_page_url`、Look 编号、重复与失效情况。\n3. 运行 `build_fashion_image_canvases.py`。\n4. 输出 `generated_canvases/00_真实图片总索引.canvas` 与 17 个分系列图库。\n\n**关键区别：**\n- `source_page_url` = 网页来源页\n- `image_url` = Canvas 真正显示图片所需的直链\n\n没有 `image_url`，Canvas 只会给你看链接，服装会继续处于唯心主义阶段。",
      "x": -300,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
